NoncePinPolicy::check1271SignedAction
├── given the config was never initialized
│   └── it should return false
├── given a payload shorter than the nonce window
│   ├── given an empty payload
│   │   └── it should return false
│   └── given any length below 52 bytes
│       └── it should return false
├── given a payload holding exactly the arbiter and nonce
│   └── it should return true
├── given the payload carries the pinned nonce
│   └── it should return true
├── given the pinned nonce is zero
│   └── it should return true
├── given the payload carries any other nonce
│   └── it should return false
├── given the digest differs but the nonce matches
│   └── it should return true regardless of the digest
└── given a pin belonging to another multiplexer, account or config
    └── it should return false
